* Absolute neutrophil count(ANC)\>0.75 x 10\^9/L, blood platelet count\>100 x 10\^9/L;
* Peripheral blood blast count \ 250 mg/dL, or 13.9\>mmol/L); b. had high blood pressure and antihypertensive drug treatment under two or unable to descend to the ranges (systolic blood pressure \ 480ms;
