COMBINATION_PRODUCT: Neoadjuvant intensity-modulated radiotherapy combined with perioperative camrelizumab and apatinib

1. Preoperative IMRT targeting PVTT and intrahepatic tumor lesions with a prescribed dose for 18Gy in 6 fractions delivered by using 6-MV X-rays with a linear accelerator at 5 fractions per week;
2. Perioperative combination of camrelizumab and apatinib Preoperatively, camrelizumab (200mg, every 2 weeks) combined with apatinib (250mg, daily) for 2 cycles (2 weeks as one cycle); Postoperatively, camrelizumab (200mg, every 3 weeks) combined with apatinib (250mg, daily) for 8 cycles (3 weeks as one cycle).

入组条件:
Inclusion Criteria:

